"Explain how nationalism spread through symbols. @ The image of Bharat Mata by Abanindranath Tagore gave a visible form to the nation as a mother @ The flag, especially the Swaraj flag with the spinning wheel designed by Gandhi in 1921, became a symbol of unity @ The Vande Mataram hymn written by Bankim Chandra Chattopadhyay inspired nationalists @ Folk tales and ballads collected by Tagore and Natesa Sastri restored pride in India's culture @ Writing of Indian history made people proud of the past",
